WEBVTT

00:11.020 --> 00:16.970
[Fenglinwan Hotel]

00:44.200 --> 00:45.000
Qiqi,

00:45.640 --> 00:46.520
I'm sorry.

00:47.840 --> 00:49.640
It's the same old problem again.

01:00.390 --> 01:01.110
It's okay.

01:02.020 --> 01:02.830
I can wait.

01:08.400 --> 01:08.930
Ms. Zhou.

01:09.200 --> 01:11.230
They're all waiting for you
to start the meeting.

01:11.230 --> 01:12.200
Let them wait.

01:12.350 --> 01:13.550
How long will that be?

01:16.470 --> 01:18.130
Wait until the cows come home.

02:38.550 --> 02:42.260
[Born with Luck]

02:42.310 --> 02:45.300
[Episode 7]

02:45.470 --> 02:46.560
What a windfall.

02:47.470 --> 02:48.560
Now I finally get

02:48.590 --> 02:50.360
why you kept provoking the bear.

02:50.360 --> 02:52.710
Turns out,
you had everything under control.

02:52.710 --> 02:54.030
I was just playing it by ear.

02:54.030 --> 02:55.430
Sometimes, you've got to improvise.

02:55.430 --> 02:56.520
Don't be so modest.

02:56.560 --> 02:57.870
If you'd told me earlier we were
doing a straight-man-funny-man act,

02:57.870 --> 02:58.890
I could've played along
even better.

02:58.890 --> 03:00.290
Alright, next time then.

03:01.030 --> 03:01.870
We tracked down the whistleblower

03:01.870 --> 03:03.190
this fast—

03:03.310 --> 03:05.590
honestly, I still can't quite believe it.

03:05.590 --> 03:07.310
No wonder Chief Zhang said before

03:07.310 --> 03:08.960
that if we want
to investigate Lu Zheng's case,

03:08.960 --> 03:10.870
we have to start
with Ye Jian's case first.

03:10.870 --> 03:13.000
That foresight is really incredible.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.160
Every case must

03:16.190 --> 03:17.310
have a crack somewhere.

03:17.310 --> 03:18.120
We just have to find it.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.980
As we keep looking, we'll find it.

03:20.750 --> 03:22.560
But Lu Yibo still refuses to say

03:22.560 --> 03:23.680
who exactly he reported.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.630
So Chief Lu's case

03:24.630 --> 03:26.160
still lacks hard evidence.

03:26.590 --> 03:27.560
Sometimes saying nothing

03:27.560 --> 03:29.240
speaks louder than anything.

03:33.079 --> 03:34.410
You reported Zhou Rong?

03:34.520 --> 03:35.850
Have you lost your mind?

03:36.079 --> 03:37.030
Six months ago,

03:37.079 --> 03:38.210
a police chief died.

03:38.870 --> 03:39.560
I had a feeling that

03:39.560 --> 03:41.030
it had something to do with Mr. Rong.

03:41.030 --> 03:42.560
So I wrote the report letter.

03:42.560 --> 03:43.520
Why?

03:43.590 --> 03:44.079
Why?

03:44.190 --> 03:45.400
Because I love you.

03:52.910 --> 03:54.310
Because of my own issues.

03:54.910 --> 03:56.110
I started suspecting

03:56.750 --> 03:57.590
you were lonely

03:57.590 --> 03:58.990
and slept with Zhou Rong.

04:00.310 --> 04:01.750
I suspected you two were having an affair.

04:01.750 --> 04:03.430
What nonsense are you talking about?

04:03.430 --> 04:04.080
I'm not that kind

04:04.080 --> 04:05.680
of woman with no boundaries!

04:06.630 --> 04:07.660
Qiqi, Qiqi.

04:07.870 --> 04:08.600
I already got

04:08.630 --> 04:09.190
the report letter back.

04:09.190 --> 04:11.390
What's the point of getting it back now?

04:11.520 --> 04:13.560
The police have already
shown up at the door.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.470
If Zhou Rong finds out

04:14.470 --> 04:15.360
you were the one who reported him—

04:15.360 --> 04:16.560
we're both finished!

04:19.190 --> 04:20.630
You're really that scared of him?

04:20.630 --> 04:22.000
Who do you think Zhou Rong is?

04:22.000 --> 04:24.130
There's nothing that man wouldn't do.

04:27.830 --> 04:29.230
Let me ask you something.

04:29.920 --> 04:31.030
Are you with me

04:31.190 --> 04:32.470
because you like me—

04:34.430 --> 04:34.870
or because

04:34.870 --> 04:36.530
I'm Zhou Rong's close friend?

04:50.390 --> 04:51.120
I love you.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.460
You're the only one I love.

04:54.070 --> 04:54.950
So we have to

04:54.950 --> 04:56.510
think long-term about this.

04:56.510 --> 04:57.310
Understand?

04:59.360 --> 05:00.160
I understand.

05:00.750 --> 05:01.920
So what do we do now?

05:14.920 --> 05:17.120
Does Zhou Rong know about your problem?

05:28.670 --> 05:30.330
We need to make the first move.

05:44.800 --> 05:45.270
Bro,

05:46.630 --> 05:47.720
I've still got some nuts left.

05:47.720 --> 05:48.720
Let's split them.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.950
I'm not hungry. You can eat them all.

05:52.159 --> 05:52.950
Cut the crap.

05:53.070 --> 05:54.000
Give me your hand.

05:54.000 --> 05:55.600
I'm not the type to hog it all.

05:55.680 --> 05:56.080
Hurry.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.430
It smells so good.

06:17.600 --> 06:19.400
Too bad there's barely any left.

06:24.270 --> 06:24.800
Bro,

06:25.430 --> 06:26.690
he still hasn't moved?

06:33.460 --> 06:34.260
Bro, can we...

06:35.510 --> 06:36.440
We can't.

06:37.310 --> 06:38.270
I know you want to leave

06:38.270 --> 06:39.600
and come back tomorrow.

06:40.190 --> 06:41.390
But what if the moment we leave,

06:41.390 --> 06:42.190
he leaves too?

06:42.830 --> 06:43.800
And tomorrow, the second we come back,

06:43.800 --> 06:44.800
he comes back too?

06:45.390 --> 06:46.650
What should we do then?

06:50.750 --> 06:51.610
It's your turn.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.510
Hello?

07:13.680 --> 07:14.540
Director Fang,

07:14.680 --> 07:16.680
this is Geng from the radio station.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.180
Hello, Director Geng.

07:18.750 --> 07:20.610
Director Fang, here's the thing—

07:21.310 --> 07:22.800
that large-scale

07:22.870 --> 07:24.430
interactive musical,

07:24.430 --> 07:25.630
and prose poetry recital you planned,

07:25.630 --> 07:27.760
"My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry"...

07:28.720 --> 07:30.340
it may need to be postponed.

07:30.480 --> 07:30.810
What?

07:31.750 --> 07:32.070
No.

07:34.120 --> 07:34.750
Why?

07:35.830 --> 07:37.430
So when exactly is it airing?

07:37.920 --> 07:38.380
Well...

07:43.240 --> 07:44.970
I'm still right here, you know!

07:45.510 --> 07:47.610
You can't treat me like this!

07:51.570 --> 07:52.730
Bro, he moved.

07:54.360 --> 07:54.950
Really?

07:55.600 --> 07:56.159
Let's go.

08:25.750 --> 08:26.190
Bro.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.240
Shouldn't we wait a little longer?

08:28.240 --> 08:30.720
Security's just
a little tighter, that's all.

08:30.720 --> 08:32.200
Do you know Warren Buffett?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.909
He makes big money—

08:34.390 --> 08:36.590
money from tens of thousands of people.

08:37.080 --> 08:38.510
And he summed it all up in one

08:38.510 --> 08:39.970
valuable piece of advice:

08:40.320 --> 08:42.360
"Be fearful when others are greedy,

08:42.630 --> 08:44.690
and greedy when others are fearful."

08:44.790 --> 08:45.650
Think about it—

08:45.910 --> 08:47.440
how many people would actually dare

08:47.440 --> 08:49.200
commit a burglary in broad daylight?

08:49.200 --> 08:50.360
When others are fearful—

08:50.360 --> 08:52.020
that's our turn to get greedy.

08:53.080 --> 08:53.740
Let's do it.

09:09.960 --> 09:10.990
In the dark night,

09:11.120 --> 09:12.330
I ride a black horse

09:12.360 --> 09:14.490
through thorns and into the darkness.

09:16.790 --> 09:18.240
The moment you wielded your long sword

09:18.240 --> 09:19.390
and slew the dragon—

09:19.410 --> 09:22.140
it made me see the morning glow
for the first time.

09:29.390 --> 09:30.950
[Incoming Call: Mentor]

09:32.030 --> 09:32.550
Mentor.

09:33.120 --> 09:33.920
Zhang Yi'ang.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.000
How is your investigation going?

09:36.000 --> 09:36.720
Ye Jian's case

09:36.720 --> 09:37.630
and Lu Zheng's case,

09:37.630 --> 09:38.830
any progress on them?

09:39.100 --> 09:39.900
Yes, there is.

09:39.960 --> 09:40.630
But,

09:40.670 --> 09:41.480
on Ye Jian's case,

09:41.480 --> 09:42.670
we ran into some obstacles.

09:42.670 --> 09:43.240
So for now,

09:43.240 --> 09:44.900
we're starting with Chief Lu's case.

09:44.900 --> 09:45.960
Alright, alright.

09:46.390 --> 09:48.050
I know what you're capable of.

09:48.550 --> 09:49.670
I have some good news.

09:49.670 --> 09:51.070
I have some good news too.

09:51.790 --> 09:53.390
Zhang Yi'ang is stepping up.

09:53.510 --> 09:53.840
Go ahead.

09:53.840 --> 09:55.100
Tell me your good news.

09:55.670 --> 09:56.790
We found the whistleblower.

09:56.790 --> 09:57.320
Who is it?

09:57.790 --> 09:58.320
Lu Yibo.

10:00.000 --> 10:00.600
Well done.

10:02.510 --> 10:04.030
The Provincial Department
just confirmed it too—

10:04.030 --> 10:05.090
the whistleblower

10:06.030 --> 10:06.970
was indeed Lu Yibo.

10:06.970 --> 10:08.430
See, it really was Lu Yibo.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.520
Zhang Yi'ang,

10:09.630 --> 10:10.630
follow this lead

10:10.630 --> 10:11.630
and keep digging.

10:11.630 --> 10:13.390
The truth is about to surface.

10:13.530 --> 10:14.440
Mentor, rest assured.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.170
Understood.

10:34.630 --> 10:35.160
Mr. Rong.

10:36.720 --> 10:37.250
Mr. Rong.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.790
Plan A:

10:43.550 --> 10:45.200
Fang Yong once published
a poetry collection,

10:45.200 --> 10:46.960
and it's impossible to find it elsewhere.

10:46.960 --> 10:47.910
The only copy left is an archive edition

10:47.530 --> 10:47.800
[My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry]

10:47.960 --> 10:48.950
at the city library.

10:47.980 --> 10:49.050
[Fang Yong]

10:49.150 --> 10:50.670
I had someone make a replica.

10:50.670 --> 10:51.670
You can take it to him

10:51.670 --> 10:52.750
and ask him to sign it—

10:52.750 --> 10:53.410
it'd also be

10:53.840 --> 10:54.720
a good chance to get closer to him.

10:54.450 --> 10:54.750
[Index]

10:57.630 --> 10:59.270
Isn't that basically piracy?

10:59.270 --> 10:59.860
Is it?

11:01.750 --> 11:03.000
You want me to walk up to the author

11:03.000 --> 11:04.080
with a pirated copy
and ask for his signature?

11:04.080 --> 11:07.000
How exactly am I supposed
to get close to him like that?

11:07.000 --> 11:09.000
My apologies, I didn't think it through.

11:09.000 --> 11:09.950
Plan B:

11:10.480 --> 11:11.750
I was going to name our company's

11:11.750 --> 11:13.210
next residential project

11:13.240 --> 11:14.970
as "Yong Residence."

11:15.270 --> 11:17.150
Then we can invite Fang Yong
to cut the ribbon.

11:17.150 --> 11:18.150
What do you think?

11:20.600 --> 11:21.950
Yong Residence...

11:22.120 --> 11:23.030
Mediocre (Yong) Residence?

11:23.030 --> 11:25.690
Does that mean
only mediocre people live there?

11:26.320 --> 11:28.120
Sorry, I didn't think
that one through either.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.320
How about this—we find a park

11:29.320 --> 11:30.150
and build a life-size bronze statue

11:30.150 --> 11:31.200
of Fang Yong?

11:31.270 --> 11:32.200
That man is alive and perfectly well.

11:32.200 --> 11:33.440
Why on earth would you
build a statue for him?

11:33.440 --> 11:34.650
Isn't that a bit over the top?

11:34.650 --> 11:36.580
-Sir. Sir.
-Let's find another...

11:36.840 --> 11:37.440
Mr. Zhou.

11:37.630 --> 11:39.150
This gentleman insisted on seeing you.

11:39.150 --> 11:39.720
I couldn't stop him.

11:39.720 --> 11:40.250
Mr. Fang.

11:46.870 --> 11:48.120
[My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry]

11:50.330 --> 11:50.890
[My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry]

12:06.290 --> 12:08.690
This copy's printed
way better than my own.

12:09.170 --> 12:10.150
Can I have it?

12:15.610 --> 12:16.320
[My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry]

12:16.040 --> 12:16.750
Mr. Fang.

12:17.330 --> 12:19.280
This is just a sample, actually.

12:19.420 --> 12:19.910
We were planning

12:19.910 --> 12:20.840
to make a gold-foil edition

12:20.840 --> 12:22.770
and have it delivered to your home.

12:22.870 --> 12:23.760
Your writing

12:23.870 --> 12:24.530
is profound

12:24.650 --> 12:26.600
and brings readers a rare sense of peace.

12:26.600 --> 12:28.150
To be honest, just now...

12:29.240 --> 12:31.750
I finished reading it
while lying on the floor.

12:31.750 --> 12:33.000
If you don't mind,

12:33.330 --> 12:34.200
please accept it.

12:33.800 --> 12:37.790
[My Distant Horizon, Your Poetry]

12:35.390 --> 12:35.960
Great.

12:40.550 --> 12:42.280
I'd love to have a chat with you.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.500
All this effort you've put in—

12:45.720 --> 12:47.180
isn't it just to talk to me?

12:47.200 --> 12:48.000
Sure.

12:48.120 --> 12:48.840
Let's talk.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.000
Let's go to my place.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.930
Can't we just talk here?

12:55.550 --> 12:57.150
I have something to show you.

13:04.020 --> 13:06.600
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

13:07.530 --> 13:08.790
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

13:10.280 --> 13:12.750
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

13:13.700 --> 13:15.050
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

13:16.120 --> 13:17.110
♪ Oh Gimme ♪

13:18.290 --> 13:20.170
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

13:21.150 --> 13:22.820
♪ Raining make it rain ♪

13:23.280 --> 13:26.050
♪ Oh cash is my revolution ♪

13:29.580 --> 13:31.710
♪ Get your head in the game,
we're all smart people here ♪

13:32.240 --> 13:34.930
♪ Don't drag your feet,
even gold slips through slow hands ♪

13:35.730 --> 13:37.340
♪ I beat it, I beat it ♪

13:38.140 --> 13:40.060
♪ Aye aye aye aye yo ♪

13:44.020 --> 13:46.600
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

13:47.530 --> 13:48.790
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

13:50.150 --> 13:52.720
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

13:53.700 --> 13:55.050
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

14:00.360 --> 14:00.670
Bro.

14:06.440 --> 14:07.770
Don't step on the floor.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.270
Bro.

14:13.390 --> 14:14.600
Are you looking for a corrupt official

14:14.600 --> 14:15.730
or a poor household?

14:19.550 --> 14:20.480
It's a disguise.

14:21.790 --> 14:25.050
The bigger the corrupt official,
the better the disguise.

14:25.550 --> 14:26.440
He can't just leave his money

14:26.440 --> 14:27.900
out in plain sight, can he?

14:30.120 --> 14:32.780
If he did, he'd have been reported
a long time ago

14:33.960 --> 14:35.220
I bet one of these rooms

14:35.270 --> 14:36.400
is packed with cash.

14:37.870 --> 14:39.000
Search thoroughly.

14:39.390 --> 14:40.790
Especially the ceiling,

14:40.790 --> 14:41.920
under the mattress,

14:42.360 --> 14:44.690
and the hidden compartments in the walls.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.190
Don't miss a single spot.

16:27.710 --> 16:28.770
Clay Figure Zhang.

16:32.720 --> 16:33.980
He’s a clean official.

16:34.240 --> 16:36.300
This fat guy must be a clean official.

16:36.790 --> 16:38.630
I searched the whole place upside down,

16:38.630 --> 16:40.910
and only found a few hundred yuan
in the shoe cabinet.

16:40.910 --> 16:41.910
Bastard.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.210
Who are you cursing?

16:46.150 --> 16:48.000
Mr. Fang, you live on the ground floor?

16:48.000 --> 16:49.020
Isn't that a bit damp?

16:49.020 --> 16:49.990
It's fine.

16:50.960 --> 16:54.360
Living on the ground floor is convenient—
easy to come and go.

17:02.960 --> 17:03.960
Military boxing.

17:04.030 --> 17:04.960
Ready to fight.

17:05.750 --> 17:06.200
One,

17:07.160 --> 17:07.589
two,

17:08.500 --> 17:08.990
three,

17:09.829 --> 17:10.349
four,

17:11.280 --> 17:11.760
five.

17:13.440 --> 17:14.410
Your place...

17:15.960 --> 17:16.640
has a kind of

17:17.069 --> 17:19.930
timeless, unpretentious
cultural elegance to it.

17:20.000 --> 17:21.200
You've got a good eye.

17:23.310 --> 17:24.270
What's this for?

17:24.960 --> 17:26.440
Mr. Fang said the frame is nice.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.829
Why don't we give it to him?

17:27.829 --> 17:29.000
It's no use leaving it in the car.

17:29.000 --> 17:30.000
Just put it there.

17:30.590 --> 17:31.440
Put it there.

17:31.550 --> 17:32.550
Please, Mr. Zhou.

17:33.000 --> 17:34.000
Please, Mr. Fang.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.340
[Fenglinwan VIP Exclusive]

17:51.240 --> 17:52.270
Whenever you have free time,

17:52.270 --> 17:54.680
come here to sing and have some tea.

17:55.440 --> 17:57.440
The girls there make excellent tea.

18:01.450 --> 18:03.000
[Fenglinwan VIP Exclusive]

18:08.440 --> 18:09.000
Mr. Zhou,

18:09.550 --> 18:11.150
what do you think of this tea?

18:12.270 --> 18:13.470
Here, smell it first.

18:17.160 --> 18:17.880
This tea

18:18.640 --> 18:19.920
has age to it.

18:20.480 --> 18:21.200
Good eye.

18:22.680 --> 18:24.200
It's a genuine 1950s

18:24.240 --> 18:25.300
old dark brick tea.

19:08.680 --> 19:09.140
Please.

19:23.750 --> 19:25.640
I believe with your

19:25.680 --> 19:26.830
cultural sensibility,

19:26.830 --> 19:27.920
you must have some unique perspectives

19:27.920 --> 19:28.550
on the cultural industry park

19:28.550 --> 19:29.880
that's being developed

19:30.270 --> 19:31.920
in the new district, right?

19:34.830 --> 19:35.750
The cultural industry park

19:35.750 --> 19:37.810
is a government investment project.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.110
I work for the government.

19:41.070 --> 19:43.480
Whether I have personal opinions
isn't the point.

19:43.480 --> 19:44.460
The point is

19:44.640 --> 19:46.440
to get the park project done right.

19:46.440 --> 19:47.640
Of course, of course.

19:47.680 --> 19:49.340
Using cultural industry as the foundation

19:49.340 --> 19:52.000
to forward the development
in the new district.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.370
So, Mr. Zhou,

19:53.400 --> 19:55.480
why bring up
the industry park all of a sudden?

19:55.480 --> 19:57.140
Do you have something in mind?

19:58.000 --> 19:58.720
Our company

19:58.750 --> 20:00.590
has been deeply rooted
in Sanjiangkou for years.

20:00.590 --> 20:01.790
We are also very experienced

20:01.790 --> 20:03.120
in project operations.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.280
And personally,

20:04.350 --> 20:06.680
I'm interested in the cultural industry.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.000
To be honest,

20:08.160 --> 20:09.920
I'd like to do some

20:09.940 --> 20:12.060
practical work in this space.

20:12.400 --> 20:13.110
So,

20:13.480 --> 20:14.880
I was wondering if you...

20:15.030 --> 20:17.960
At the end of the day,
isn't this all just about money?

20:20.590 --> 20:21.310
This industry park

20:21.310 --> 20:23.310
comes with substantial
government matching funds

20:23.310 --> 20:24.540
and tax incentives.

20:25.160 --> 20:25.820
Therefore,

20:26.440 --> 20:28.410
many companies are eyeing

20:28.440 --> 20:29.700
on this industry park.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.570
I personally think

20:33.720 --> 20:36.320
what matters most
is getting it done properly.

20:37.920 --> 20:39.030
My biggest concern is that

20:39.030 --> 20:40.230
once some developers

20:40.640 --> 20:42.040
get hold of this project,

20:42.720 --> 20:44.880
they will just line their own pockets,

20:45.070 --> 20:46.030
cut corners,

20:46.400 --> 20:48.600
and eventually mess the whole thing up.

20:49.000 --> 20:49.440
Mr. Fang,

20:49.440 --> 20:51.070
you absolutely don't need
to worry about that.

20:51.070 --> 20:51.670
No company

20:51.680 --> 20:53.480
can swallow the whole pie alone.

20:54.270 --> 20:55.030
If this project

20:55.030 --> 20:56.310
were handed to our Rongcheng Group,

20:56.310 --> 20:57.960
I guarantee it will be done perfectly.

20:57.960 --> 20:59.690
Then we'll make the pie bigger.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.920
And this pie...

21:01.750 --> 21:03.350
has to be shared by everyone.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.370
This cake,

21:19.200 --> 21:21.130
how exactly do you want to share it?

21:22.830 --> 21:24.030
To be honest with you,

21:24.310 --> 21:25.440
our company has already done

21:25.440 --> 21:27.400
a financial analysis on this project.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.240
Indeed,

21:28.640 --> 21:29.720
it's profitable.

21:30.360 --> 21:31.560
And if we do it,

21:31.830 --> 21:33.240
we won't hesitate
to spend where it matters.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.510
Every angle will be fully covered.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.410
For example,

21:35.720 --> 21:38.320
the "consulting fee"
for your preferred firm?

21:42.350 --> 21:44.180
Are you trying to bribe me?

21:50.510 --> 21:51.040
Mr. Zhou.

21:51.720 --> 21:52.720
This way, please.

22:03.680 --> 22:06.370
How can the water stay so clear?

22:06.640 --> 22:09.440
Because fresh water flows from the source.

22:15.510 --> 22:17.170
Mr. Fang, I misspoke earlier.

22:17.200 --> 22:18.880
That wasn't what I meant at all.

22:18.880 --> 22:21.070
This is the authentic work of Yu Yueran.

22:21.070 --> 22:22.880
That piece of calligraphy you have

22:22.880 --> 22:23.740
is way too fake.

22:25.510 --> 22:26.750
This way, Mr. Zhou.

22:43.550 --> 22:44.510
This is a genuine Yuan dynasty

22:44.510 --> 22:47.510
blue-and-white porcelain
chilong-handled tripod.

22:51.590 --> 22:52.610
Normally, I wouldn't even

22:52.610 --> 22:54.010
let anyone lay eyes on it.

23:09.830 --> 23:12.090
Genuine Tang Tri-Color Glazed Pottery.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.330
Clay Figure Zhang.

23:15.270 --> 23:17.270
The piece may be small,

23:18.240 --> 23:19.480
but is exquisite.

23:38.720 --> 23:40.750
These two round-backed armchairs
you're sitting on

23:40.750 --> 23:42.950
are made of authentic Hainan rosewood.

23:45.750 --> 23:47.550
There's also a large bed inside.

23:47.550 --> 23:49.610
I usually don't even dare sleep on it.

23:50.640 --> 23:51.300
Have a seat.

24:02.680 --> 24:03.590
Actually, I'm

24:03.640 --> 24:04.830
not like most people.

24:04.830 --> 24:06.360
I don't care much for money.

24:06.790 --> 24:08.790
My greatest passion is collecting.

24:09.790 --> 24:10.680
As you can see,

24:11.550 --> 24:13.280
everything I have in this house

24:14.240 --> 24:16.170
is a reflection of my true passion.

24:17.680 --> 24:19.240
Mr. Fang, you are an educated man.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.510
You're on a completely different level.

24:20.510 --> 24:21.860
Unlike us businessmen,

24:22.200 --> 24:23.860
who just pile money up at home.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.880
We feel so shallow

24:25.200 --> 24:26.130
compared to you.

24:29.920 --> 24:30.890
In my whole life,

24:30.920 --> 24:32.680
I've never taken
a single cent from anyone.

24:32.680 --> 24:33.350
And I certainly won't

24:33.350 --> 24:35.080
be making an exception for you.

24:36.360 --> 24:37.890
Most of the things in my home

24:38.400 --> 24:39.800
were given to me as gifts.

24:46.510 --> 24:48.510
My favorite pieces are bronzeware.

24:50.000 --> 24:51.000
But there are only

24:51.110 --> 24:52.840
a few small pieces left at home.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.440
What I want most is a full set

24:58.240 --> 24:59.040
of bianzhong.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.160
If I could have a set of bianzhong

25:02.160 --> 25:03.360
displayed in my home,

25:04.830 --> 25:06.690
I would be completely satisfied.

25:08.000 --> 25:10.550
A set of bianzhong.

25:11.400 --> 25:12.070
Got it?

25:14.110 --> 25:14.640
Got it.

25:15.510 --> 25:16.400
Right turn.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.370
Forward, march.

25:18.720 --> 25:20.960
One-one, one-two-one.

25:21.200 --> 25:23.480
One-one, one-two-one.

25:23.640 --> 25:26.030
One, two, three, four!

25:41.680 --> 25:43.010
Unlike us businessmen,

25:43.390 --> 25:45.050
who just pile money up at home.

25:45.590 --> 25:47.520
We feel so shallow compared to you.

25:49.790 --> 25:50.270
Bro,

25:50.550 --> 25:51.310
for the first time in my life,

25:51.310 --> 25:52.790
I've ever seen an idiot

25:52.830 --> 25:54.270
telling two robbers

25:54.440 --> 25:55.830
that there's money in the house.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.960
Bro, why don't we find another target?

25:58.550 --> 26:00.830
That fat guy really is a corrupt official.

26:00.830 --> 26:02.690
My judgment was right, wasn't it?

26:03.160 --> 26:04.470
But antiques

26:04.790 --> 26:06.160
aren't liquid assets.

26:06.440 --> 26:08.270
We can't sell them like commodities.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.870
Cash is much more practical.

26:11.200 --> 26:12.200
Rongcheng Group,

26:12.590 --> 26:13.650
I'm taking it down.

26:22.030 --> 26:23.210
Mr. Rong,

26:23.590 --> 26:25.500
a set of bianzhong isn't cheap.

26:25.790 --> 26:27.850
It'll cost at least tens of millions.

26:27.940 --> 26:29.430
[Auction Records for Bronze Bianzhong]

26:28.000 --> 26:28.960
This Fang Yong

26:29.480 --> 26:31.080
has quite the appetite.

26:32.270 --> 26:34.260
Do we have any connections?

26:35.310 --> 26:36.310
I'll look into it.

26:36.880 --> 26:38.000
Go find a way.

26:45.240 --> 26:46.100
Let's try this.

26:50.530 --> 26:56.480
[Gym]

26:55.510 --> 26:56.440
Mr. Rong.

26:58.400 --> 26:59.960
Did something happen at Fenglinwan?

26:59.960 --> 27:01.990
[Gym]

27:00.240 --> 27:01.100
It's nothing.

27:01.480 --> 27:02.070
It's fine.

27:02.070 --> 27:03.200
Everything is fine.

27:03.350 --> 27:04.960
As long as everything's okay.

27:04.960 --> 27:05.420
Lately,

27:05.550 --> 27:07.160
I've been busy with East New Town.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.830
I haven't had much time for you guys.

27:08.830 --> 27:09.720
Since you're here,

27:09.720 --> 27:10.880
let's go get some food together.

27:10.880 --> 27:11.680
Get it sorted.

27:11.680 --> 27:12.160
Okay.

27:17.720 --> 27:19.450
You, step outside for a moment.

27:25.110 --> 27:25.680
Mr. Rong,

27:28.830 --> 27:30.290
I want to admit my mistake.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.370
I made a mistake.

27:32.030 --> 27:33.850
I secretly wrote
to the Provincial Department

27:33.850 --> 27:34.850
and reported you.

27:35.480 --> 27:37.000
Then at the memorial service,

27:37.000 --> 27:37.830
Zhang Yi'ang and the others

27:37.830 --> 27:38.840
recognized me.

27:39.240 --> 27:40.310
You reported me?

27:43.820 --> 27:45.280
What did you report me for?

27:45.880 --> 27:47.200
You're such a man of integrity—

27:47.200 --> 27:49.600
there wasn't actually anything to report.

27:49.680 --> 27:50.920
So I just made things up.

27:50.920 --> 27:51.440
I...

27:51.880 --> 27:52.610
said you were

27:53.000 --> 27:54.000
evading taxes...

27:54.400 --> 27:56.110
said you were a market bully,

27:56.440 --> 27:58.830
and your private life was a complete mess.

27:58.880 --> 27:59.600
Shut up!

28:00.920 --> 28:01.980
So Zhang Yi'ang came
from the provincial capital

28:01.980 --> 28:03.780
to investigate Lu Zheng's case.

28:03.830 --> 28:04.880
Did you mention Lu Zheng?

28:04.880 --> 28:05.590
No.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.550
Absolutely not!

28:06.550 --> 28:07.270
I swear.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.270
I definitely didn't say a word about him.

28:08.270 --> 28:09.800
Haven't I treated you well?

28:10.510 --> 28:12.240
-Why did you report me?
-Rong!

28:12.270 --> 28:14.270
Rong!

28:14.640 --> 28:15.530
I thought...

28:15.680 --> 28:17.590
you and Qiqi were together.

28:19.310 --> 28:20.890
Are you insane?

28:21.200 --> 28:21.940
Mr. Rong.

28:22.270 --> 28:23.600
Take it easy, calm down.

28:23.720 --> 28:25.850
It'll look bad if this gets out of hand.

28:28.590 --> 28:29.200
Mr. Rong,

28:30.030 --> 28:31.490
I lost my head for a moment.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.870
I'm truly sorry.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.970
I was jealous of you.

28:35.200 --> 28:37.160
I was jealous that you're a real man.

28:37.160 --> 28:39.110
I was jealous
that you have four girlfriends.

28:39.110 --> 28:41.240
I was jealous that you have
a wild nightlife every single night.

28:41.240 --> 28:42.110
I was jealous that

28:42.110 --> 28:43.960
you're surrounded by women everyday.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.400
I only have Qiqi.

28:45.880 --> 28:46.350
And I...

28:46.750 --> 28:48.640
I haven't even touched her yet.

28:50.030 --> 28:50.550
Rong,

28:51.340 --> 28:51.780
I...

28:53.160 --> 28:55.190
I'm just not capable!

29:01.600 --> 29:02.650
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:02.650 --> 29:03.570
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:03.570 --> 29:04.480
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:04.480 --> 29:05.110
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:05.110 --> 29:05.790
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:05.790 --> 29:06.920
Mr. Rong, I'm sorry!

29:10.270 --> 29:11.670
Have you taken your meds?

29:13.850 --> 29:15.720
I've been...

29:15.920 --> 29:17.450
seeing a TCM doctor lately.

29:20.510 --> 29:21.000
Rong,

29:22.000 --> 29:23.350
are you not mad at me anymore?

29:23.350 --> 29:24.780
Of course I'm mad!

29:26.510 --> 29:28.640
We've been friends since we were kids.

29:29.510 --> 29:31.240
I never thought it would be you.

29:31.590 --> 29:32.220
Don't worry.

29:32.220 --> 29:33.880
I already got the letter back.

29:34.510 --> 29:35.350
As far as the police know,

29:35.350 --> 29:36.950
I never mentioned you at all.

29:41.030 --> 29:42.630
I'll trust you one more time.

29:43.790 --> 29:44.720
But Zhang Yi'ang

29:45.400 --> 29:46.160
might not.

29:47.350 --> 29:50.080
I have a feeling
he'll come looking for you again.

29:50.400 --> 29:50.790
Then,

29:51.480 --> 29:52.240
if he comes,

29:52.270 --> 29:53.960
what should I say?

29:55.830 --> 29:56.760
Tell him exactly

29:57.920 --> 29:59.120
what you just told me.

30:00.720 --> 30:01.350
Yibo,

30:02.590 --> 30:03.590
telling the truth

30:04.050 --> 30:05.910
is always more useful than lying.

30:11.070 --> 30:11.680
Okay.

30:17.270 --> 30:18.000
Chief Zhang.

30:18.160 --> 30:19.550
I've thought it through.

30:19.550 --> 30:21.160
Please come to Fenglinwan again.

30:21.160 --> 30:22.620
I'll tell you everything.

30:22.880 --> 30:23.350
Okay.

30:24.680 --> 30:25.280
Very good.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.360
Goodbye.

30:28.160 --> 30:28.940
Chief,

30:29.160 --> 30:30.030
working cases with you

30:30.030 --> 30:31.840
feels easier than ever.

30:33.640 --> 30:35.700
Why do I feel like something is fishy?

30:36.480 --> 30:37.610
Could this be a trap?

30:38.110 --> 30:39.040
What do you mean?

30:39.680 --> 30:40.540
Think about it.

30:40.680 --> 30:42.290
Lu Yibo wrote the report letter

30:42.290 --> 30:44.420
and sent it to the provincial capital—

30:44.590 --> 30:45.920
which means

30:45.920 --> 30:47.850
he originally intended to report.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.720
But then he took

30:50.270 --> 30:51.600
the report letter back—

30:51.960 --> 30:53.750
which means he didn't want to report.

30:53.750 --> 30:54.880
When we tracked him down,

30:54.880 --> 30:56.200
he admitted it immediately—

30:56.200 --> 30:57.790
which means he did want to report.

30:57.790 --> 30:58.880
But he hesitated and wouldn'ts say

30:58.880 --> 31:00.080
who he was reporting—

31:00.550 --> 31:02.610
which means he didn't want to report.

31:03.480 --> 31:05.210
Now he's asking us to come over—

31:05.440 --> 31:07.400
which means he wants to report again.

31:07.400 --> 31:09.000
Does he want to report or not?

31:10.150 --> 31:12.750
This guy's living
in constant contradiction.

31:14.310 --> 31:16.260
Could it be that he's terrified

31:16.310 --> 31:17.480
of the person he's reporting,

31:17.480 --> 31:19.010
so he's deeply conflicted?

31:20.070 --> 31:21.400
If he were truly terrified,

31:21.400 --> 31:22.640
he wouldn't have used his real name.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.640
But he didn't report under his real name.

31:23.640 --> 31:24.830
There was no name on that report letter.

31:24.830 --> 31:27.230
It was only because Chief Zhang stepped...

31:30.640 --> 31:32.590
Chief Zhang stepped on a piece of paper,

31:32.590 --> 31:34.390
then we found the report letter.

31:36.000 --> 31:36.640
So,

31:37.750 --> 31:38.790
I'm wondering

31:39.400 --> 31:40.270
whether all of this

31:40.270 --> 31:41.680
is a big misleading.

31:42.510 --> 31:44.170
It feels more like a trap to me.

31:47.590 --> 31:49.320
Chief Zhang, what do you think?

32:06.880 --> 32:07.550
The night

32:08.550 --> 32:10.200
gave me dark eyes,

32:12.350 --> 32:15.240
but I use them to seek the light.

32:20.530 --> 32:24.660
[Fenglinwan]

32:52.550 --> 32:53.200
Chief Zhang,

32:53.200 --> 32:55.260
how should we question him this time?

32:56.550 --> 32:57.750
If you're planning to improvise again,

32:57.750 --> 32:59.000
give me a heads-up first.

32:59.000 --> 33:00.510
I'm worried I won’t catch the setup

33:00.510 --> 33:01.350
and drop the whole act.

33:01.350 --> 33:01.830
No.

33:03.270 --> 33:04.270
Let's do it like last time.

33:04.270 --> 33:05.030
Didn't that work pretty well?

33:05.030 --> 33:06.430
We'll just play it by ear.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.150
It seems

33:08.240 --> 33:10.170
we can only fill in the gaps as we go.

33:11.480 --> 33:13.810
What kind of jargon are you talking about?

33:15.310 --> 33:17.170
You don't watch crosstalk at all?

33:21.440 --> 33:22.220
Let's say,

33:22.350 --> 33:23.400
spend 200 yuan

33:23.440 --> 33:24.830
to buy a little golden piggy.

33:24.830 --> 33:26.160
It squeals when it drinks water,

33:26.160 --> 33:27.640
crunches when it eats beans.

33:27.640 --> 33:28.630
Along the wall,

33:28.680 --> 33:30.110
then toss it outside.

33:30.240 --> 33:31.270
And it gives a squeak.

33:31.270 --> 33:32.390
Guess what?

33:34.240 --> 33:34.840
It's dead?

33:37.310 --> 33:38.240
Is it dead ot not?

33:49.510 --> 33:50.310
Have some tea.

33:58.480 --> 34:00.010
I've figured it out myself.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.210
Actually,

34:01.270 --> 34:02.750
about the report letter earlier,

34:02.750 --> 34:04.880
I felt I owed you a proper explanation.

34:08.110 --> 34:09.000
We can drink this tea now, right?

34:09.000 --> 34:10.130
Yes, yes, of course.

34:15.230 --> 34:15.710
Well,

34:17.400 --> 34:18.170
Mr. Lu

34:18.320 --> 34:19.190
is Sanjiangkou's

34:19.190 --> 34:20.590
outstanding entrepreneur.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.150
I'm flattered.

34:21.150 --> 34:21.790
And we

34:21.840 --> 34:23.900
are also willing to hear your report.

34:29.670 --> 34:30.860
But actually, that report letter

34:30.860 --> 34:31.460
is fake.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.230
Fake?

34:37.920 --> 34:38.540
Mr. Lu,

34:38.840 --> 34:41.030
writing a false report letter
is against the law.

34:41.030 --> 34:41.409
Yes.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.320
That's exactly why I rushed

34:42.320 --> 34:43.440
to the provincial capital
overnight to retrieve it.

34:43.440 --> 34:44.000
I didn't expect

34:44.000 --> 34:45.800
it'd cause such a big misunderstanding.

34:45.800 --> 34:47.190
It really took up

34:47.230 --> 34:48.510
our valuable police resources.

34:48.510 --> 34:51.239
I'm willing to accept
any punishment or penalty.

35:01.070 --> 35:01.880
The provincial capital explosion case—

35:01.880 --> 35:03.880
does it have anything to do with you?

35:05.480 --> 35:07.610
You mean the manhole cover explosion?

35:07.630 --> 35:08.360
That has absolutely

35:08.360 --> 35:09.560
nothing to do with me.

35:09.760 --> 35:10.960
Then what a coincidence

35:10.960 --> 35:11.590
that you just happened to be there

35:11.590 --> 35:12.840
at the explosion site.

35:12.840 --> 35:13.900
What a coincidence indeed.

35:13.900 --> 35:14.670
But the explosion

35:14.670 --> 35:16.230
has absolutely nothing to do with me.

35:16.230 --> 35:17.630
I was a victim too.

35:17.760 --> 35:18.960
I got covered in shit.

35:20.480 --> 35:21.440
What kind of terrorist

35:21.440 --> 35:23.100
gets himself covered in shit?

35:23.800 --> 35:24.600
Wait a minute.

35:31.150 --> 35:32.080
Liu'an Guapian.

35:32.240 --> 35:33.050
Good tea.

35:33.110 --> 35:34.310
It is Liu'an Guapian.

35:34.670 --> 35:35.200
Officer,

35:36.480 --> 35:37.400
you pronounced "Guapian" right.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.280
But the first two characters,

35:38.280 --> 35:38.880
Lu'an.

35:40.070 --> 35:40.730
It's Lu'an.

35:42.920 --> 35:43.360
Yeah.

35:43.490 --> 35:44.000
Right.

35:44.230 --> 35:44.670
Lu'an.

35:45.400 --> 35:46.000
Look at me—

35:46.960 --> 35:48.230
my taste buds got it right,

35:48.230 --> 35:49.510
but my mouth slipped
and said the wrong thing.

35:49.510 --> 35:50.640
It's Lu'an Guapian.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.440
Nice tea.

36:00.510 --> 36:01.710
You...

36:02.370 --> 36:03.360
What... what Liu?

36:03.360 --> 36:04.220
Lu'an Guapian.

36:04.280 --> 36:05.140
Lu'an Guapian.

36:05.670 --> 36:06.530
Let me try some.

36:11.400 --> 36:11.920
Mr. Lu.

36:13.000 --> 36:13.840
Didn't you understand

36:13.840 --> 36:15.170
what Chief Zhang meant?

36:15.230 --> 36:16.960
There was a hidden message in his words.

36:16.960 --> 36:19.150
Right now, we're simply asking questions.

36:19.150 --> 36:20.230
But if this turns into an interrogation,

36:20.230 --> 36:22.150
it would be a very different conversation.

36:22.150 --> 36:23.510
Understood. Understood.

36:23.510 --> 36:25.840
Chief Zhang truly is a great detective
from the Provincial Department.

36:25.840 --> 36:27.840
Nothing can possibly hide from him.

36:28.150 --> 36:29.150
He's reminding me

36:29.150 --> 36:30.280
to watch what I say.

36:32.320 --> 36:33.570
You're very sharp.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.560
In that case,

36:34.590 --> 36:35.790
let's keep it simple.

36:35.800 --> 36:37.960
Let's put everything on the table.

36:44.880 --> 36:45.540
Is there...

36:47.920 --> 36:49.720
an unspoken reason behind this?

36:55.450 --> 36:57.440
I'm not capable!

37:00.190 --> 37:01.850
You figured that out already?

37:02.800 --> 37:03.280
Well,

37:03.640 --> 37:04.590
it's obvious.

37:04.630 --> 37:05.360
Too obvious.

37:05.920 --> 37:07.320
How could I not notice it?

37:08.030 --> 37:08.800
Just tell us.

37:09.110 --> 37:10.440
We will keep it a secret.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.110
The unspoken reason...

37:12.110 --> 37:13.510
is my private matter.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.880
But regarding that report letter,

37:15.880 --> 37:17.210
it's authentically...

37:17.230 --> 37:18.150
fake.

37:19.280 --> 37:20.250
Is it true or false?

37:20.250 --> 37:21.150
Don't leave us hanging,

37:21.150 --> 37:21.710
okay?

37:22.320 --> 37:24.920
I told you this guy is
a walking contradiction.

37:25.190 --> 37:26.710
Whether it's true or false,

37:26.710 --> 37:28.310
you wrote the report letter,

37:28.550 --> 37:30.280
so we still have to look into it.

37:36.230 --> 37:37.090
We already know

37:37.110 --> 37:38.370
that you reported him.

37:39.510 --> 37:41.150
The question is, why did you...

37:41.150 --> 37:42.770
I did report him.

37:42.960 --> 37:43.510
But everything I wrote

37:43.510 --> 37:44.670
was all made up.

37:44.800 --> 37:46.460
So it doesn't matter who it is.

37:46.880 --> 37:48.280
Since it doesn't matter,

37:48.710 --> 37:49.920
then why are you hiding it?

37:49.920 --> 37:50.400
Right.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.630
Let's just be straight with each other.

37:52.630 --> 37:53.830
Let's talk about him.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.840
I reported Zhou Rong,

37:56.840 --> 37:58.770
but it was a big misunderstanding.

38:10.670 --> 38:12.330
You and Zhou Rong are friends.

38:14.150 --> 38:15.750
More than friends, I assume?

38:16.540 --> 38:17.920
We're close friends. Childhood friends.

38:17.920 --> 38:19.630
Since you are childhood friends,

38:19.630 --> 38:20.840
whether it's true or false,

38:20.840 --> 38:22.500
this just doesn't make sense.

38:26.070 --> 38:27.480
Why did you report Zhou Rong?
